-- 6. Introduction paragraph
UPDATE projects SET introduction = introduction || '

Two extension strands were added in October 2026: The Nature of Schooling and The Languages of Being Human. They have no counterpart in the Bio-Core model. They reuse the shared vocabulary of the first four strands (Teaching, Scaffolding, Institutions, Communication, Representation and others) and bring those concepts to the centre of a part for the first time. They are AI-drafted proposals. They stay in draft status, outside the comparison views, until a reviewer accepts them.' WHERE id = '371fce26-d1f3-439b-95df-0a0e38b8a824' AND introduction NOT LIKE '%Two extension strands were added in Octo%';

